@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@contentType = application/json
@lang = es
@targetUserId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### Login (el token lleva el rol en el claim groups)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}

{
  "email": "hexi@hexarch.org",
  "password": "Passw0rd123"
}

@accessToken = {{login.response.body.data.accessToken}}

### Detalle de usuario (solo requiere estar autenticado)
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Banear - requiere USER_BAN (MODERATOR o ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/ban
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Desbanear - requiere USER_BAN
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/unban
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Cambiar rol - requiere USER_ROLE_ASSIGN (solo ADMIN)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/role
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "role": "MODERATOR"
}

### AUTHZ-001 sin permiso: repetir el ban con un token de PLAYER
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/ban
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
Accept-Language: {{lang}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 401 sin token
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/users/{{targetUserId}}/ban
Content-Type: {{contentType}}
